      "name": "World radio row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "world-row",
      "description": "Checked world row; selection is expressed by aria-checked and a roving tabindex in the app.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-world\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\"><svg class=\"ds-world-symbol\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 15A9 9 0 0 1 9 4a9 9 0 1 0 11 11Z M16 3v4m-2-2h4\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>Moon</strong><span>Low gravity. Wide open wonder.</span></span><span class=\"ds-best\"><span>BEST</span><b>0</b></span><span class=\"ds-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-world{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;width:100%;min-height:77px;padding:14px 14px 14px 7px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#f3f3dc);text-align:left;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#afc2bc38);cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s}.ds-world:hover{background:#dbe8d909}.ds-world[aria-checked=true]{background:#dbe8d90d}.ds-world:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#e9edaa);outline-offset:5px}.ds-world .ds-world-symbol{width:29px;height:29px;fill:none;stroke:var(--muted,#b4c1bc);stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .25s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-world[aria-checked=true] .ds-world-symbol{stroke:var(--accent,#e9edaa);transform:translateX(2px)}.ds-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-copy strong{font-size:18px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-world[aria-checked=true] .ds-copy strong{color:var(--accent,#e9edaa)}.ds-copy>span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#b4c1bc);line-height:1.4}.ds-best{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;min-width:27px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-best span{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted,#b4c1bc)}.ds-best b{font-size:15px;font-weight:650}.ds-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border:1px solid var(--muted,#b4c1bc);border-radius:50%;margin-left:5px}.ds-world[aria-checked=true] .ds-dot{background:var(--accent,#e9edaa);border-color:var(--accent,#e9edaa);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--surface,#131e24)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation-duration:.001ms!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Graphics select",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "select",
      "description": "Native select with active-world surface, divider, and focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-select-label\">Graphics <select class=\"ds-select\"><option>Auto</option><option>High</option><option>Low</option></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-select-label{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#f3f3dc);font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.ds-select{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#f3f3dc);background:var(--deep,#070e15);border:1px solid var(--line,#afc2bc38);border-radius:6px;padding:9px 25px 9px 10px;font-size:13px;max-width:110px}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#e9edaa);outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation-duration:.001ms!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}}"
    },
